WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A gorilla was placed in a stack of lung scans.
Twenty of twenty-four radiologists did not report it.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Twelve of those who missed it
looked directly at its location.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Their eyes reached the image.
That does not mean attention recognized the surprise.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The study tells us something about a task,
not about a meditation recording.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 sells a twelve-minute listening format.
One-hour equivalence needs product-specific proof.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve-minute routine first.
Then compare the exact package and terms.
